{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1789745399000-dcea6e", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "下周有客户来验厂，接待流程怎么安排？", "id": "b498c83c024d4a058de1fc4c9d82d777", "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:29:59", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "ea74fe990a2240e384c55b529098c33b", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:29:59", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "2dca315fd3f3412d8c71231de87ca1ac", "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:30:07", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T15:30:49"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**验厂接待流程**\n1. 提前 2 天：确认人数/时间/参观动线，发来访登记预填表\n2. 当天：前台登记发访客牌 → 会议室简报（公司介绍 10min）→ 车间参观（按固定动线，避开在制品区）→ 答疑\n3. 会后：24h 内发会议纪要与整改承诺表\n注意事项：车间安全帽提前备 10 顶，参观路线提前清障。", "id": "2af66a2436e647719175f1241f1ee068", "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:30:07", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T15:30:49"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "b306a74fd9174932848d7e6fef769ebc", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:30:07", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-18T15:30:49", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "需要走什么审批？", "id": "a90fe4f4853f4d9f9bd3c03066e6c4fe", "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:32:49", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "956d625f2b454c9a9d17d752a35b969e", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:32:49", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "d34975e6caa3451bbe5e451ac06d5edc", "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:32:55", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T15:33:24"}, {"type": "text", "text": "常规流程：部门经理 → 归口部门（人事/行政/财务）备案即可；涉及预算或跨部门的加一级分管审批。企微审批里已有对应模板，搜关键词就能发起。", "id": "70aee8e1224f4841a581a2f0ec6b081f", "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:32:55", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T15:33:24"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "86e1bcc6d5c24318aedabf7ad09a16ae", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:32:55", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-18T15:33:24", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}